WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:10.300
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:21.310
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.790
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:37.250
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.300
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.590
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.470
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.680
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:01:00.350
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:09.030
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:16.030
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.500
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:24.670
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:41.260
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:45.400
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.090
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.840
Summoned to
the alternate world Cephiro...

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:57.000
...the three overcame the trials
to become Magic Knights at Eterna...

00:01:57.110 --> 00:02:00.050
...and acquired
the legendary ore escudo.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:10.150
The only one who can create
weapons out of escudo...

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.390
...is Master Smith Presea.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:18.260
Hikaru and company are returning
to Presea in the Forest of Silence.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:24.340
Lives at Stake - Presea's Weapons

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:32.010
What?

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.450
What?
An earthquake?

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:40.120
In Cephiro's case, is it not
true that monster encounters...

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.210
...are more frequent
than earthquakes?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.590
Don't say freaky stuff like that!

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:57.200
Do you think it's okay
to surprise people like that?

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.070
Hikaru, you need
to discipline that thing!

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.740
Uh, I don't think that's the problem...

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.350
Clef!

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:19.350
The ground shaking is a sign that
Cephiro is starting to crumble.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.830
Hurry, children of another world.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.030
If Cephiro completely crumbles...

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:29.190
...you will not be able
to return to your world.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:34.570
You've got to be kidding!
Trapped forever in this world...

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.370
...with no convenience stores,
ice cream shops, or bookstores?

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.110
I won't take it! I won't take it at all!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:44.350
To recall convenience stores now...
Ms. Umi is an amazing person.

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.350
Hurry, but take the utmost caution.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:53.120
One of Zagato's minions
awaits you in the Forest of Silence.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:57.230
If Cephiro completely crumbles...

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:00.270
...you will not be able
to return to your world.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:02.940
Clef!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.300
I wanted to hear more...

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.200
About you too, Clef...

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.770
Hikaru...

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.840
Let's hurry to Presea's place!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.230
I don't hear
the screaming of monsters lately...

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.000
What's going on?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.640
Cephiro is starting to crumble...

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.240
...just as Master Mage Clef said.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.480
Really, these soldiers lately...

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:03.030
They just order weapons
and never come pick them up.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.190
Y-You're... Master Mage Clef!

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.790
Have you heard from
the previous master smith?

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.940
About the Magic Knights.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.140
I'm so sorry.
I have heard about them.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:23.580
I was told to make weapons for
them when Cephiro faced danger.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.650
Unfortunately, that time has come.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.980
Are you ready?

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:31.660
Yes!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.290
Yes!
All right. Take my hand.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.700
This is...

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.110
The Forest of Silence.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:56.650
The one where
monsters roam about...

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:01.020
High Priest Zagato has taken
Princess Emeraude captive.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:02.490
What?

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:07.260
You are the only one who can
create weapons from escudo.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:10.130
I cannot allow you
to fall prey to Zagato.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:11.930
Yes.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.770
The Forest of Silence is horrendous,
but magic can't be used here.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.930
Even Zagato can't
lay hands on you easily.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:22.580
Only the Magic Knights
can open this house's door.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:24.410
Although if Zagato were serious...

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:28.710
...entering would be as
simple as taking candy from a baby.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.050
I will not die.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:32.480
Presea...

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:36.790
Not until I create the weapons that
I can entrust to the Magic Knights.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.520
I'm glad that
you are the master smith.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.590
I'm sure you will
do the job wonderfully.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:44.160
I am honored.

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.840
Master Mage Clef...

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:14.260
Well now... I wonder how
I should play with those girls.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:15.450
I know!

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:23.330
Beast Summon!

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:35.370
Atalante, I'm glad you came.
Let's play a fun game today.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.710
Look at my hands.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.110
Good boy. Now go get it.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.280
What?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.280
I hope they're all right.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.690
I hope that they're not hurt.

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:26.660
At first, I couldn't believe that
those girls were the Magic Knights.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.600
Delicious.

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.000
Mokona!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.540
You made me waste
the food Hikaru gave me!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.770
How should I punish you?

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:43.150
Shall I pull on your ears
to see how far they stretch?

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.380
The fact Mokona is here means...

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.380
Hikaru! Umi! Fuu!

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:51.580
Mokona!

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:54.420
I'm so glad. You're all right.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.460
Girls, your armor.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:00.590
They changed when
we touched the escudo at Eterna.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.530
Master Mage Clef
gave you that armor, right?

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.130
Yeah.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:09.470
Master Mage Clef provided
you with armor that evolves.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.070
They'll grow like your weapons.

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.270
So that was it.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.940
In any case, hurry and follow me.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:20.150
I want to make the ultimate
weapons for you right away.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.610
Right!

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:28.550
This is my forge.
The place where I make weapons.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.930
Here?

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:33.830
You do not need tools
to create weapons, I see.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:38.270
Right, all you need is a strong will.
Now take the escudo out.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:39.340
Right!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.680
P-Presea...

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.760
Watch closely.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:05.300
Ultimate weapons are made like this.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.900
So that's how weapons are made...

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.710
What was that?

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.210
Let's go look, Umi, Fuu!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:00.450
Wait. I'll go too.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:04.920
No! Presea, you should
do what you're supposed to.

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.390
Your job is to make weapons.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.290
So leave everything else to us.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.600
That's why we're here.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:20.000
What you say makes sense.
All right, I'll leave it to you.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.470
Right! Let's go, Umi, Fuu!

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:23.540
Yeah.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:28.610
They've become much stronger in
the little while I haven't seen them.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.850
I know. I have a job to do.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:53.670
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:03.520
What is that thing?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:28.240
Umi! Fuu! Let's go!

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.310
Right!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.640
Flame Arrow!

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:43.020
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:48.820
Emerald Typhoon!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.670
We did it!

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:17.080
Ms. Hikaru, once more!

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.160
Yeah!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.540
The magic didn't work!

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:42.880
It builds a resistance
to spells after being hit once.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.320
This isn't the time to be impressed!

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:56.730
Hikaru!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:01.130
My job is to create weapons.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:17.080
Ruby Lightning!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:22.350
Water Dragon!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.870
If magic doesn't work, then weapons!

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.000
Got it!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:58.850
Oh my!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.660
Weapons don't work either.

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:49.170
How stupid. There's
no way they can beat Atalante.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.870
They're so stubborn.

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:58.140
I'm getting sleepy.

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:01.090
I'll take a nap until Atalante wins.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.440
Hikaru!

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.100
Why?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.760
It seems that it has
a target other than us.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.660
The escudo?

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.740
Or Ms. Presea...

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.870
We've got to protect
Presea no matter what!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:03.910
It's just a caterpillar...
Why is it so fast?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:07.180
I'll run ahead of its path to distract it...

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.980
...then you two will attack, Umi, Fuu.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.150
What?

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:14.320
Why did my sword...

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.020
The forge...

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:18.630
Presea!

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:19.760
Run!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:27.940
Done.

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.280
Presea!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:44.320
Hikaru, magic doesn't work!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.090
I'll make it stop with my will!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.300
I won't let you have Presea!

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:56.460
Ruby Lightning!

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.490
The wind's so strong!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:23.760
How...

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:26.230
How can I save Presea?

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:35.360
They're done!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.170
Presea!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:41.980
Escudo...

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.140
Presea...

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.340
Presea!

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.260
Escudo!

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.510
Ms. Umi, we should too.

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:07.530
Ms. Umi, we should too.
Yeah!

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:08.900
Escudo!

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.550
Presea, hold on.

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.520
The swords?

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.200
We got them.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:06.120
I'm glad...

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:09.960
Please become
the Magic Knights and save Cephiro...

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.200
Presea...

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:15.470
That food... was very delicious.

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:17.710
Thank you, Hikaru.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.210
I think I have one more piece!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.710
Master Mage Clef...

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.720
This is the way it should be, right?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:28.910
Presea...

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:46.000
Come back, Atalante!

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.570
Come back!

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:51.710
No matter how much
you call, it will not come back.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.680
Atalante listens to anything I say!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.420
If I call, it will come back!

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:00.090
That's if it's still alive.

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.420
What do you mean?

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.250
See for yourself.

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:10.520
Atalante!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.260
Atalante!

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.130
Atalante!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.180
What have they done to you?

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.710
I'll make sure I avenge your death.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:35.250
I'll never let them
get away with doing this to you!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.130
Presea, I promise...

00:21:56.240 --> 00:22:01.040
...that we'll save Cephiro with
the swords you gave your life for.

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:31.240
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.810 --> 00:22:38.410
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:45.420
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:49.990
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:55.460
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:58.100
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:03.010
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:10.680
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:16.690
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:23.860
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:29.800
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:49.580
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:52.460
Ferio, to save Princess Emeraude...

00:23:52.560 --> 00:23:55.360
...approached
Summoner Ascot by himself.

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:58.300
However,
Ferio then double-crossed us.

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:02.660
He lured us out into
the desert and put us in danger.

00:24:03.640 --> 00:24:05.700
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.300
Ferio in Desperation -
A Romance in the Desert.

00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:09.440
Please be sure to watch it!

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:10.680
Ferio in Desperation -
A Romance in the Desert
Please be sure to watch it!

00:24:10.680 --> 00:24:13.450
Ferio in Desperation -
A Romance in the Desert

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:20.380
Who is it today?

00:24:21.490 --> 00:24:23.350
Today, it's Fuu!

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:24.360
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.360 --> 00:24:27.130
Look forward to the next episode!
Everyone, did you guess correctly?

00:24:27.130 --> 00:24:28.600
Look forward to the next episode!
Till next time!

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:29.430
Look forward to the next episode!
